- allow_low_downloads (toolchain-manager/mise/config/.config/mise.toml): no hijack path. Scoped name (@askviraj/) — only the scope owner can publish; exact pin 1.1.6 recorded in a tracked .config/mise.lock (lockfile = true); the exemption is this package only — its dependencies still pass the download threshold, the malicious-package check and minimum_release_age = "10h". Remaining risk is the owner's npm account, pre-existing. Stricter than pnpm dlx, which fetched whatever the registry served.
